{"unit_id":"symmetryseeker__dsh-akn-plugin#card-zh","repo":"symmetryseeker/dsh-akn-plugin","commit":"1fef6c849b89d9c4e499055cb4c26713c956fe76","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-akn-plugin 是面向 DSH Web 的 Cordis 插件：它在会话与工具、技能等配置变化时生成 Harness Manifest 快照，并保存到本地 SQLite。它关联当前模型、Harness 配置和环境，供可选的 experience_search 查询经验卡片，也可用 experience_feedback 保存本地反馈。适合希望在 DSH 中积累运行快照并查找可复用经验的用户。默认本地运行，不需 API key；Hub 查询与 Skill 资源捕获可按配置启用。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-plugin/src/coordinator.ts:296-352","packages/dsh-plugin/src/consumer.ts:23-35","packages/dsh-plugin/src/index.ts:23-48"]}
